[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10922.87, "timestamp": "03:02:02", "text": "嗯。讓我想想。如果"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10932.816, "timestamp": "03:02:12", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "to much white"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10933.51, "timestamp": "03:02:13", "text": "話題都是些不好的、色情的東西，那你能問什麼呢？嗯。我的意思是，我覺得達娜，這會是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10935.51, "timestamp": "03:02:15", "text": "採訪之類的嗎？我很期待明天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10937.51, "timestamp": "03:02:17", "text": "但這是為了吸引觀眾。不。哦，你可以那樣做。那樣能吸引"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10954.87, "timestamp": "03:02:34", "text": "觀眾。呃，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10956.38, "timestamp": "03:02:36", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hmm hmm"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10959.99, "timestamp": "03:02:39", "text": "如果是影片的話，那還好。如果是直播的話，他們會想，那個東西在哪裡？那個噱頭在哪裡？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10963.11, "timestamp": "03:02:43", "text": "或者不管你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10965.03, "timestamp": "03:02:45", "text": "放在縮圖裡的東西是什麼，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10966.87, "timestamp": "03:02:46", "text": "想看，你什麼時候問"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10972.95, "timestamp": "03:02:52", "text": "？然後他們就會想，他們會等著，人們都在等著，等等。我在這上面投入了太多精力，我覺得我需要學習影片剪輯、影片上傳之類的東西，這樣我才能明白哪些方法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10976.07, "timestamp": "03:02:56", "text": "有效，哪些無效"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10976.37, "timestamp": "03:02:56", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "it for financial year stiff"}]